    "problem": "Which of the following values is **not** in the range of $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x?$",
    "worked_solution": "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038821/assets/d7984b9098d02bfc2b1e9a422aef919533abce54fbb94117e709c7613b0870a3.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The range of the function is $y\\in (-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{\\pi }{2}).$\n\nTherefore, the value $y=-\\frac{5\\pi }{6}$ is not in the range of the function.",
